messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nXiao Yan was looking at a shoe in the shopping mall and was struggling to decide whether to buy black or white. Xiaofang, a good friend of mine, said: You can ask the teller whether black has the highest sales volume or white has the highest sales volume. Don't you know?\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is most similar to the question-and-answer approach in the stem?\n# Options:\nA) Xiao zhang, who was preparing for the postgraduate entrance examination, was hesitating between the a training class and the b training class. his roommate xiao wang said: you go and ask the seniors and sisters who have been admitted to the graduate school to see if they applied for a or b, no. did you know?\nB) Lao zheng intends to buy a gift for his comrade-in-arms lao yuan, who is moving to a new house. he is in a dilemma between calligraphy, calligraphy and painting and artistic bonsai. his wife said, go to the flower shop and ask. there are not many people who move in and send art bonsai, so i don't know. do you.\nC) Xiao mo and her boyfriend went to the internet celebrity food street to search for food. faced with many local specialties that they had never eaten before, they didn't know how to choose. the boyfriend said, let's see which store has the longest queue at the entrance, and then go to eat at which one. bar.\nD) The qixi festival is coming, xiao wang is going to give his girlfriend a lipstick. i don't know whether her girlfriend likes the color number 001 or the color number 006. colleague xiaolin suggested that you can check which color number is the most popular on the internet and choose which one.. I think the correct option is: C\n", "To solve this logical reasoning problem, we need to identify the approach used in the context and find the option that most closely mirrors this approach.\n\nIn the context, Xiao Yan is trying to decide between two options (black or white shoes) and is advised to ask the teller which color has the highest sales volume. The key elements here are:.\n1. A decision between two options.\n2. Seeking advice based on popularity or sales volume.\n\nNow, let's analyze each option:.\n\nA) Xiao Zhang is deciding between two training classes (a and b) and is advised to ask seniors who have been admitted to the graduate school which class they applied for. This involves a decision between two options and seeking advice based on the success of others, but it's not directly about popularity or sales volume.\n\nB) Lao Zheng is deciding between three gift options (calligraphy, calligraphy and painting, and artistic bonsai) and is advised to ask at the flower shop. This involves a decision but does not clearly involve seeking advice based on popularity or sales volume.\n\nC) Xiao Mo and her boyfriend are deciding which restaurant to eat at and are advised to choose the one with the longest queue. This involves a decision and seeking advice based on popularity (indicated by the queue length), which closely mirrors the approach in the context.\n\nD) Xiao Wang is deciding between two lipstick colors (001 and 006) and is advised to check which color is the most popular on the internet. This involves a decision between two options and seeking advice based on popularity, which also closely mirrors the approach in the context.\n\nBetween options C and D, both involve making a decision based on popularity. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
