messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nAutism affects social interaction, language communication, hobbies and other aspects of behavior. Researchers have discovered that if the neuronectin protein in the experimental mice is synthesized too much, it can lead to autism. Therefore, they believe that autism has an important relationship with the amount of neuroconnect protein synthesis.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following, if true, best supports the above view?\n# Options:\nA) Laboratory rats living in groups are less likely to suffer from autism than those living alone\nB) The proportion of male laboratory rats suffering from autism is 5 times that of female laboratory rats\nC) Inhibition of neuronectin protein synthesis can relieve autism symptoms in experimental mice\nD) If the key genes that control protein synthesis in experimental mice are removed, the neuronectin in their bodies will increase. I think the correct option is: D\n', "To solve this logical reasoning problem, we need to identify which option best supports the view that autism has an important relationship with the amount of neuronectin protein synthesis.\n\nLet's analyze each option:.\n\nA) Laboratory rats living in groups are less likely to suffer from autism than those living alone.\n- This statement talks about the social environment affecting autism but does not directly address the relationship between neuronectin protein synthesis and autism.\n\nB) The proportion of male laboratory rats suffering from autism is 5 times that of female laboratory rats.\n- This statement discusses the gender ratio in autism but does not provide information about neuronectin protein synthesis.\n\nC) Inhibition of neuronectin protein synthesis can relieve autism symptoms in experimental mice.\n- This statement directly links neuronectin protein synthesis to autism symptoms. If inhibiting the synthesis of neuronectin can relieve autism symptoms, it strongly supports the idea that neuronectin protein synthesis is related to autism.\n\nD) If the key genes that control protein synthesis in experimental mice are removed, the neuronectin in their bodies will increase.\n- This statement talks about the genetic control of neuronectin synthesis but does not directly link neuronectin levels to autism symptoms. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
