messages:   56%|#####6    | 336/600 [02:41<04:10,  1.05it/s][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nIn recent years, community banks in some big cities have been closed frequently. At the same time, a series of new banks, such as unmanned banks, 5G banks and smart banks, keep emerging. Bank branches are bidding farewell to cold glass counters and metal benches. The traditional transaction processing functions of bank branches are weakened, and customized services, product experience, social interaction and other functions are increasingly prominent. As a result, some experts predict that traditional bank branches will disappear within 20 years.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the followings, if true, best supports the expert's view?\n# Options:\nA) Customers need to enter the door to take the number, wait for the number, to deal with a simple business cost a long time\nB) The introduction of artificial intelligence and other technological means has changed people's impression of bank branches\nC) Complex business must be signed face to face at the bank branch, such as account opening, account cancellation, etc., must be handled by myself and manual audit\nD) Online banking, mobile banking and other emerging, bank outlets as the main channel of service is weakening. I think the correct option is: B\n", 'To solve this logical reasoning problem, we need to identify which option best supports the expert\'s prediction that traditional bank branches will disappear within 20 years. Let\'s analyze each option in the context of the provided information:.\n\nA) "Customers need to enter the door to take the number, wait for the number, to deal with a simple business cost a long time.".\n- This option highlights a drawback of traditional bank branches but does not directly support the prediction of their disappearance. It only points out inefficiencies.\n\nB) "The introduction of artificial intelligence and other technological means has changed people\'s impression of bank branches.". Therefore, my final option is: ']]
